{"id":"45a3e012-c832-4dc8-8fe9-9b54a14eed6a","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:25:47.238Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Aus dem Parallelogramm unten wurde ein Kreis mit Durchmesser "},{"type":"math","src":"d = 12 \,\mathrm{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" ausgeschnitten. Die Länge "},{"type":"math","src":"l","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" beträgt "},{"type":"math","src":" 20 \,\mathrm{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":". Berechne den Flächeninhalt der Figur. Runde das Ergebnis auf ganze Zahlen."}]}],"id":"80c4889d-a90d-45ca-82b3-41b714f0c329"},{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f5dee3b5db71_d5fe3ea2d2b72c967dbabd16c95088fcaca17cc6.PNG","caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"71dcdc5d-5568-4a54-a912-ff5ccd763f09"}},"id":"5273d8ce-8c3b-40a7-a64e-aab168bddca7"}],"id":"793f725d-baa1-4317-9ba8-153b9abc8993"},"interactive":{"plugin":"inputExercise","state":{"type":"input-expression-equal-match-challenge","unit":"cm²","answers":[{"value":"127","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Sehr gut!"}]}],"id":"86823a48-82bb-48d9-9efe-af6560dd1aab"}},{"value":"Etwa 127","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Sehr gut!"}]}],"id":"67a5c184-79d8-4d85-9ce6-563d3111f5de"}},{"value":"etwa 127","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Sehr gut!"}]}],"id":"d77392e1-bb7f-4ddc-9caf-5990ffdee985"}}]},"id":"cb9ec1c6-ea96-4863-96cd-153d64bcf9b9"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"prerequisite":{"id":"154847","title":"Flächeninhalt zusammengesetzter Figuren"},"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"25276612-f4ee-461e-b13d-d19dc3917bab"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Im Voraus musst du eine allgemeine Formel aufstellen, mit der du den gesamten Flächeninhalt berechnen kannst. Die Figur setzt sich zusammen aus einem Parallelogramm, aus dem ein "},{"type":"a","href":"1553","children":[{"text":"Kreis"}]},{"text":" ausgeschnitten wurde. Das bedeutet, dass der Flächeninhalt des Kreises von dem des Parallelogramms abgezogen werden muss."}]}],"id":"885c36c8-5353-4ce6-827c-d73aeceee889"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl} A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& A_{\mathrm{Parallelogramm}} &-& A_{\mathrm{Kreis}} \\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& l \cdot h &-& \pi r^2
   \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"3ba24c7c-bbbc-43cf-8f97-08f8e02c1956"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Die Höhe "},{"type":"math","src":"h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" des Parallelogramms kann ersetzt werden durch den Kreisdurchmesser "},{"type":"math","src":"d","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":", da der Kreis die gleiche Höhe besitzt wie das Parallelogramm."}]}],"id":"70430c20-bb7c-4b57-be92-9ba0bf5db926"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Für den Flächeninhalt des Kreises, ist es nötig den Radius "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" aus dem Durchmesser "},{"type":"math","src":"d","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" zu berechnen und einzusetzen, wie folgt:"}]}],"id":"ec308e84-2bb6-4d88-a4ad-03ef2880e039"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"d = 2r \Rightarrow r = \dfrac{d}{2}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"﻿"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl} 
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& l \cdot d &-& \pi r^2 \\\\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& l \cdot d &-& \pi \cdot \Big(\dfrac{d}{2}\Big)^2 \\\\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& 20 \,\mathrm{cm} \cdot 12\,\mathrm{cm} &-& \pi \cdot \Big(\dfrac{12 \,\mathrm{cm}}{2}\Big)^2 \\\\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& 240 \,\mathrm{cm^2} &-& 36\pi\,\mathrm{cm^2} \\\\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &\approx& 127 \,\mathrm{cm^2}
  \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"d1af7dd2-0117-41bb-8fcc-cb193b4b9e1b"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Daraus folgt, dass der Gesamtflächeninhalt ca. "},{"type":"math","src":"127 \,\mathrm{cm^2}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" beträgt."}]}],"id":"b4607f45-1227-4ed1-8024-55dfca384bcd"}],"id":"5b1929a9-e6fe-44c7-b69a-0341f002badf"}},"id":"548d0b5c-c91a-4fef-8d2b-03f90216eb88"}},"id":"f90a8eb9-9abd-49c4-91c7-5d4b297ea56d"}}
